{"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"list":[{"id":"p_seed_040","createdAt":"2026-09-13T18:07:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:33:45.040Z","author":{"uid":"u_book","name":"读库笔记","handle":"reading_notes","verified":false,"bio":"读书、看展、逛博物馆","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"国产动画电影票房破纪录，工业化制作体系逐渐成型。所谓工业化，就是让「出一部好作品」从运气变成流程。#动画#","images":["./img/news/a-n_mu1zjfgcwt7734-cover.jpg","./img/news/17-ent-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_0268y5i","title":"国产动画电影票房破纪录：工业化制作体系逐渐成型","summary":"国产动画电影票房刷新纪录，制作方披露，影片由两百余家团队协作完成，虚拟拍摄与云端渲染大幅缩短了制作周期。","cover":"./img/news/20-ent-cover.jpg","channel":"ent","channelName":"娱乐","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":["动画"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":387,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"views":15143,"bookmarks":28},"score":23.5,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T18:07:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_028","createdAt":"2026-09-13T17:43:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:33:45.054Z","author":{"uid":"u_may","name":"街拍阿May","handle":"may_street","verified":false,"bio":"用照片记录城市的光","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"第一次进数据中心参观，最冲击的不是机器多，而是安静——安静得能听见自己的脚步。那种「庞大的东西安静地运转」的感觉很难描述。#纪录片#","images":["./img/news/04-video-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_045lv5o","title":"纪录片片段：数据中心的一天，算力是如何被调度的","summary":"当你在手机上点击一次 AI 对话，背后是什么在运转？本期视频走进数据中心，记录算力调度的日常。","cover":"./img/news/01-video-cover.jpg","channel":"video","channelName":"视频","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":["纪录片"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":689,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"views":17547,"bookmarks":25},"score":32.7,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T17:43:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_011","createdAt":"2026-09-13T16:31:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:33:45.070Z","author":{"uid":"u_flash","name":"寰宇快讯","handle":"huanyu_flash","verified":true,"bio":"寰宇新闻网官方账号 · 24 小时滚动播报","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"全国统一查询平台上线后，二手车最怕的「信息不对称」被削掉一大块。买二手车终于不用靠运气和人脉了。","images":["./img/news/34-finance-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"